{"id": 2333, "date": "2026-10-18T09:50:57", "date_gmt": "2026-10-18T09:50:57", "guid": {"rendered": "https://medluxlife.de/health/clinical-treatments/plastic-surgery/brazilian-butt-lift/", "raw": "https://medluxlife.de/health/clinical-treatments/plastic-surgery/brazilian-butt-lift/"}, "modified": "2026-10-18T10:10:15", "modified_gmt": "2026-10-18T10:10:15", "password": "", "slug": "brazilian-butt-lift", "status": "publish", "type": "page", "link": "https://medluxlife.de/health/clinical-treatments/plastic-surgery/brazilian-butt-lift/", "title": {"raw": "Brazilian Butt Lift (BBL)", "rendered": "Brazilian Butt Lift (BBL)"}, "content": {"raw": "<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-lead\">In a Brazilian Butt Lift, fat is removed by liposuction from areas such as the abdomen or flanks, purified and transferred to the buttocks for more volume and shape. MedLuxLife arranges your online consultation with the surgeon in Istanbul and organises your stay.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1418,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/korperkonturierung-mit-fetttransfer-in-der-klinik-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Illustration of fat transfer areas for a Brazilian butt lift\" class=\"wp-image-1418\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section medlux-facts-sec\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section medlux-facts-sec\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Quick facts</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-facts\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-facts\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-fact\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-fact\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-card-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-fact-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-label\">Anaesthesia</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-fact-value\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-value\">General anaesthesia</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-fact\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-fact\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-card-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-fact-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-label\">Operation time</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-fact-value\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-value\">About 3\u20135 hours</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-fact\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-fact\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-card-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-fact-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-label\">Hospital stay</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-fact-value\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-value\">Usually 1\u20132 nights</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-fact\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-fact\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-card-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-fact-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-label\">Compression garment</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-fact-value\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-value\">For about 6 weeks</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-fact\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-fact\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-card-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-fact-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-label\">Stay in T\u00fcrkiye</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-fact-value\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-value\">Planned individually with the clinic</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-facts-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-facts-note\">General information; your surgeon plans the details for you personally.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section medlux-suitable\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section medlux-suitable\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who it may be suitable for</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"medlux-checklist\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list medlux-checklist\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You would like more volume and a different shape of the buttocks.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You have enough body fat in other areas for the transfer.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Your weight has been stable for some time.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You are in good general health.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-suitable-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-suitable-note\">Whether the procedure is suitable for you is decided by the surgeon after a personal assessment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How the operation is performed</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid medlux-centered-cards medlux-stages\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"14rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid medlux-centered-cards medlux-stages\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-card-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Preparation and anaesthesia</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After a detailed consultation about your wishes and your health, the operation takes place under general anaesthesia.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-card-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Liposuction and fat harvesting</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Fat is removed by liposuction from areas such as the abdomen, flanks or thighs \u2013 this also shapes these areas.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-card-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Purification and fat transfer</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The fat is purified, and healthy fat cells are transferred to specific areas of the buttocks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-card-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Closure and recovery</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The small incisions are closed and a compression garment is put on. You usually stay in hospital for 1\u20132 nights.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How it works with MedLuxLife</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-steps medlux-steps\\u002d\\u002dlist\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps medlux-steps--list\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span class=\"medlux-step-no\">1</span>Contact and online consultation</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Contact us and tell us what you are interested in. We refer you to the right surgeon for an online consultation. Photos or medical documents go directly to the doctor, only on request.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span class=\"medlux-step-no\">2</span>Your personal plan</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The surgeon recommends the right approach for you. We plan your dates, flights, hotel and transfers around it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span class=\"medlux-step-no\">3</span>Arrival and surgery</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After a pre-operative examination, the operation takes place as planned. You usually stay in hospital for 1\u20132 nights.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span class=\"medlux-step-no\">4</span>Recovery in Istanbul</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You rest in your hotel and attend the check-ups at the clinic. The surgeon decides when you are ready to fly home.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span class=\"medlux-step-no\">5</span>Back home</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Stay in touch with us on WhatsApp \u2013 we help with follow-up questions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Recovery step by step</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid medlux-centered-cards medlux-timeline\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"14rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid medlux-centered-cards medlux-timeline\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-time-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-time-label\">Weeks 1\u20133</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Avoid sitting directly on your buttocks for 2\u20133 weeks; a special pillow helps when sitting is necessary.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-time-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-time-label\">Weeks 1\u20136</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The compression garment is worn for about 6 weeks to reduce swelling and support the new contour.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-time-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-time-label\">Months 1\u20133</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Part of the transferred fat is naturally absorbed by the body in the first months; the rest stays.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion {\"className\":\"medlux-faq\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div role=\"group\" class=\"wp-block-accordion medlux-faq\"><!-- wp:accordion-item {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">How long does the operation take?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>About 3\u20135 hours under general anaesthesia, depending on the amount of fat, usually with 1\u20132 nights in hospital.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Can I sit after a BBL?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Avoid sitting directly on your buttocks for about 2\u20133 weeks; a special pillow helps when you need to sit.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Does all of the transferred fat stay?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>No. Usually about 60\u201370% of the transferred fat stays; the rest is naturally absorbed by the body during the first 3 months.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">How long should I stay in T\u00fcrkiye?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is planned individually with the clinic. We organise your flights and hotel accordingly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Should I send photos or medical documents to MedLuxLife?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>No. If the surgeon needs photos or documents, you share them directly with the doctor in your online consultation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-cta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your BBL</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Contact us and tell us what you are interested in \u2013 we refer you to the right specialist for an online consultation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-whatsapp\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-disclaimer\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n", "rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-e35d3e13 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"medlux-lead wp-block-paragraph\">In a Brazilian Butt Lift, fat is removed by liposuction from areas such as the abdomen or flanks, purified and transferred to the buttocks for more volume and shape. MedLuxLife arranges your online consultation with the surgeon in Istanbul and organises your stay.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/korperkonturierung-mit-fetttransfer-in-der-klinik-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Illustration of fat transfer areas for a Brazilian butt lift\" class=\"wp-image-1418\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/korperkonturierung-mit-fetttransfer-in-der-klinik-opt.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/korperkonturierung-mit-fetttransfer-in-der-klinik-opt-300x200.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/korperkonturierung-mit-fetttransfer-in-der-klinik-opt-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/korperkonturierung-mit-fetttransfer-in-der-klinik-opt-768x512.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/korperkonturierung-mit-fetttransfer-in-der-klinik-opt-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section medlux-facts-sec has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Quick facts</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-facts is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-fact has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-label wp-block-paragraph\">Anaesthesia</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-value wp-block-paragraph\">General anaesthesia</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-fact has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-label wp-block-paragraph\">Operation time</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-value wp-block-paragraph\">About 3\u20135 hours</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-fact has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-label wp-block-paragraph\">Hospital stay</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-value wp-block-paragraph\">Usually 1\u20132 nights</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-fact has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-label wp-block-paragraph\">Compression garment</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-value wp-block-paragraph\">For about 6 weeks</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-fact has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-label wp-block-paragraph\">Stay in T\u00fcrkiye</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-value wp-block-paragraph\">Planned individually with the clinic</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-facts-note wp-block-paragraph\">General information; your surgeon plans the details for you personally.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section medlux-suitable has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who it may be suitable for</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list medlux-checklist\">\n<li>You would like more volume and a different shape of the buttocks.</li>\n\n\n<li>You have enough body fat in other areas for the transfer.</li>\n\n\n<li>Your weight has been stable for some time.</li>\n\n\n<li>You are in good general health.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-suitable-note wp-block-paragraph\">Whether the procedure is suitable for you is decided by the surgeon after a personal assessment.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How the operation is performed</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid medlux-centered-cards medlux-stages is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3d9eeadc wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Preparation and anaesthesia</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">After a detailed consultation about your wishes and your health, the operation takes place under general anaesthesia.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Liposuction and fat harvesting</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Fat is removed by liposuction from areas such as the abdomen, flanks or thighs \u2013 this also shapes these areas.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Purification and fat transfer</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The fat is purified, and healthy fat cells are transferred to specific areas of the buttocks.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Closure and recovery</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The small incisions are closed and a compression garment is put on. You usually stay in hospital for 1\u20132 nights.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How it works with MedLuxLife</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps medlux-steps--list is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span class=\"medlux-step-no\">1</span>Contact and online consultation</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Contact us and tell us what you are interested in. We refer you to the right surgeon for an online consultation. Photos or medical documents go directly to the doctor, only on request.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span class=\"medlux-step-no\">2</span>Your personal plan</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The surgeon recommends the right approach for you. We plan your dates, flights, hotel and transfers around it.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span class=\"medlux-step-no\">3</span>Arrival and surgery</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">After a pre-operative examination, the operation takes place as planned. You usually stay in hospital for 1\u20132 nights.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span class=\"medlux-step-no\">4</span>Recovery in Istanbul</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You rest in your hotel and attend the check-ups at the clinic. The surgeon decides when you are ready to fly home.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span class=\"medlux-step-no\">5</span>Back home</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Stay in touch with us on WhatsApp \u2013 we help with follow-up questions.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Recovery step by step</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid medlux-centered-cards medlux-timeline is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3d9eeadc wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<p class=\"medlux-time-label wp-block-paragraph\">Weeks 1\u20133</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Avoid sitting directly on your buttocks for 2\u20133 weeks; a special pillow helps when sitting is necessary.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<p class=\"medlux-time-label wp-block-paragraph\">Weeks 1\u20136</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The compression garment is worn for about 6 weeks to reduce swelling and support the new contour.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<p class=\"medlux-time-label wp-block-paragraph\">Months 1\u20133</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Part of the transferred fat is naturally absorbed by the body in the first months; the rest stays.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n\n\n\n<div data-wp-context=\"{ &quot;autoclose&quot;: false, &quot;accordionItems&quot;: [] }\" data-wp-interactive=\"core/accordion\" role=\"group\" class=\"wp-block-accordion medlux-faq is-layout-flow wp-container-core-accordion-is-layout-9d106e0c wp-block-accordion-is-layout-flow\">\n<div data-wp-class--is-open=\"state.isOpen\" data-wp-context=\"{ &quot;id&quot;: &quot;accordion-item-6&quot;, &quot;openByDefault&quot;: false }\" data-wp-init=\"callbacks.initAccordionItems\" data-wp-on-window--hashchange=\"callbacks.hashChange\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-item is-layout-flow wp-container-core-accordion-item-is-layout-1ff0f1e1 wp-block-accordion-item-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"accordion-item-6-panel\" data-wp-bind--aria-expanded=\"state.isOpen\" data-wp-on--click=\"actions.toggle\" id=\"accordion-item-6\" type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">How long does the operation take?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n\n\n\n<div aria-labelledby=\"accordion-item-6\" data-wp-bind--hidden=\"state.isHidden\" data-wp-on--beforematch=\"actions.handleBeforeMatch\" id=\"accordion-item-6-panel\" role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel is-layout-flow wp-block-accordion-panel-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">About 3\u20135 hours under general anaesthesia, depending on the amount of fat, usually with 1\u20132 nights in hospital.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div data-wp-class--is-open=\"state.isOpen\" data-wp-context=\"{ &quot;id&quot;: &quot;accordion-item-7&quot;, &quot;openByDefault&quot;: false }\" data-wp-init=\"callbacks.initAccordionItems\" data-wp-on-window--hashchange=\"callbacks.hashChange\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-item is-layout-flow wp-container-core-accordion-item-is-layout-1ff0f1e1 wp-block-accordion-item-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"accordion-item-7-panel\" data-wp-bind--aria-expanded=\"state.isOpen\" data-wp-on--click=\"actions.toggle\" id=\"accordion-item-7\" type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Can I sit after a BBL?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n\n\n\n<div aria-labelledby=\"accordion-item-7\" data-wp-bind--hidden=\"state.isHidden\" data-wp-on--beforematch=\"actions.handleBeforeMatch\" id=\"accordion-item-7-panel\" role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel is-layout-flow wp-block-accordion-panel-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Avoid sitting directly on your buttocks for about 2\u20133 weeks; a special pillow helps when you need to sit.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div data-wp-class--is-open=\"state.isOpen\" data-wp-context=\"{ &quot;id&quot;: &quot;accordion-item-8&quot;, &quot;openByDefault&quot;: false }\" data-wp-init=\"callbacks.initAccordionItems\" data-wp-on-window--hashchange=\"callbacks.hashChange\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-item is-layout-flow wp-container-core-accordion-item-is-layout-1ff0f1e1 wp-block-accordion-item-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"accordion-item-8-panel\" data-wp-bind--aria-expanded=\"state.isOpen\" data-wp-on--click=\"actions.toggle\" id=\"accordion-item-8\" type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Does all of the transferred fat stay?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n\n\n\n<div aria-labelledby=\"accordion-item-8\" data-wp-bind--hidden=\"state.isHidden\" data-wp-on--beforematch=\"actions.handleBeforeMatch\" id=\"accordion-item-8-panel\" role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel is-layout-flow wp-block-accordion-panel-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">No. Usually about 60\u201370% of the transferred fat stays; the rest is naturally absorbed by the body during the first 3 months.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div data-wp-class--is-open=\"state.isOpen\" data-wp-context=\"{ &quot;id&quot;: &quot;accordion-item-9&quot;, &quot;openByDefault&quot;: false }\" data-wp-init=\"callbacks.initAccordionItems\" data-wp-on-window--hashchange=\"callbacks.hashChange\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-item is-layout-flow wp-container-core-accordion-item-is-layout-1ff0f1e1 wp-block-accordion-item-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"accordion-item-9-panel\" data-wp-bind--aria-expanded=\"state.isOpen\" data-wp-on--click=\"actions.toggle\" id=\"accordion-item-9\" type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">How long should I stay in T\u00fcrkiye?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n\n\n\n<div aria-labelledby=\"accordion-item-9\" data-wp-bind--hidden=\"state.isHidden\" data-wp-on--beforematch=\"actions.handleBeforeMatch\" id=\"accordion-item-9-panel\" role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel is-layout-flow wp-block-accordion-panel-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This is planned individually with the clinic. We organise your flights and hotel accordingly.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div data-wp-class--is-open=\"state.isOpen\" data-wp-context=\"{ &quot;id&quot;: &quot;accordion-item-10&quot;, &quot;openByDefault&quot;: false }\" data-wp-init=\"callbacks.initAccordionItems\" data-wp-on-window--hashchange=\"callbacks.hashChange\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-item is-layout-flow wp-container-core-accordion-item-is-layout-1ff0f1e1 wp-block-accordion-item-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"accordion-item-10-panel\" data-wp-bind--aria-expanded=\"state.isOpen\" data-wp-on--click=\"actions.toggle\" id=\"accordion-item-10\" type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Should I send photos or medical documents to MedLuxLife?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n\n\n\n<div aria-labelledby=\"accordion-item-10\" data-wp-bind--hidden=\"state.isHidden\" data-wp-on--beforematch=\"actions.handleBeforeMatch\" id=\"accordion-item-10-panel\" role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel is-layout-flow wp-block-accordion-panel-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">No. If the surgeon needs photos or documents, you share them directly with the doctor in your online consultation.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your BBL</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Contact us and tell us what you are interested in \u2013 we refer you to the right specialist for an online consultation.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer wp-block-paragraph\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n</div>\n\n", "protected": false, "block_version": 1}, "excerpt": {"raw": "", "rendered": "<p>In a Brazilian Butt Lift, fat is removed by liposuction from areas such as the abdomen or flanks, purified and transferred to the buttocks for more volume and shape. MedLuxLife arranges your online consultation with the surgeon in Istanbul and organises your stay. Quick facts Anaesthesia General anaesthesia Operation time About 3\u20135 hours Hospital stay [&hellip;]</p>\n", "protected": false}, "author": 2, "featured_media": 0, "parent": 263, "menu_order": 0, "comment_status": "closed", "ping_status": "closed", "template": "page-with-title", "meta": {"footnotes": ""}, "permalink_template": "https://medluxlife.de/health/clinical-treatments/plastic-surgery/%pagename%/", "generated_slug": "brazilian-butt-lift-bbl", "class_list": ["post-2333", "page", "type-page", "status-publish", "hentry"], "_links": {"self": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/2333", "targetHints": {"allow": ["GET", "POST", "PUT", "PATCH", "DELETE"]}}], "collection": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages"}], "about": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/types/page"}], "author": [{"embeddable": true, "href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/users/2"}], "replies": [{"embeddable": true, "href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/comments?post=2333"}], "version-history": [{"count": 3, "href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/2333/revisions"}], "predecessor-version": [{"id": 2394, "href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/2333/revisions/2394"}], "up": [{"embeddable": true, "href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/263"}], "wp:attachment": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/media?parent=2333"}], "wp:action-publish": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/2333"}], "wp:action-unfiltered-html": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/2333"}], "wp:action-assign-author": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/2333"}], "curies": [{"name": "wp", "href": "https://api.w.org/{rel}", "templated": true}]}}